			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 204,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 688699726,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778851827357,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "2. 数据集构建\n\n输入文件：\n- tpm_table.csv\n- genome.fa\n- annotation.gff3\n\n外部数据库：\n- NCBI / Ensembl Fungi\n- FungiDB / MycoCosm / AspGD\n- JASPAR / CIS-BP / FIMO\n\n清洗步骤：\n- 统一 ID\n- 提取上游 1000 bp\n- 负链反向互补\n- 处理重叠基因\n- 清洗 N_ratio / GC / repeat\n- 去重和相似性 split",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "2. 数据集构建\n\n输入文件：\n- tpm_table.csv\n- genome.fa\n- annotation.gff3\n\n外部数据库：\n- NCBI / Ensembl Fungi\n- FungiDB / MycoCosm / AspGD\n- JASPAR / CIS-BP / FIMO\n\n清洗步骤：\n- 统一 ID\n- 提取上游 1000 bp\n- 负链反向互补\n- 处理重叠基因\n- 清洗 N_ratio / GC / repeat\n- 去重和相似性 split",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "a6",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "phase3-bg",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 40,
