		{
			"id": "xqGOmMeY",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 70,
			"y": -135,
			"width": 336.23980712890625,
			"height": 607.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e65100",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 302,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 168058766,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778851827357,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "3. 模型训练路线\n\n第一层：k-mer + XGBoost\n- k-mer 是特征，不是模型\n- XGBoost 是回归模型\n- CPU 可跑\n- 看 Spearman / Top-K\n\n第二层：one-hot + CNN\n- one-hot 是编码方法\n- CNN 学局部 motif\n- Colab / Kaggle GPU\n\n第三层：DNA Transformer\n- DNABERT-2 embedding + XGBoost\n- DNABERT-2 embedding + MLP\n- 冻结 DNABERT-2 + regression head\n- Nucleotide Transformer embedding\n\n不建议：\n- 从零训练大型 Transformer\n- 第一版全量微调大模型\n\n输出：\n- best_predictor\n- model_config\n- model_comparison_report",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "3. 模型训练路线\n\n第一层：k-mer + XGBoost\n- k-mer 是特征，不是模型\n- XGBoost 是回归模型\n- CPU 可跑\n- 看 Spearman / Top-K\n\n第二层：one-hot + CNN\n- one-hot 是编码方法\n- CNN 学局部 motif\n- Colab / Kaggle GPU\n\n第三层：DNA Transformer\n- DNABERT-2 embedding + XGBoost\n- DNABERT-2 embedding + MLP\n- 冻结 DNABERT-2 + regression head\n- Nucleotide Transformer embedding\n\n不建议：\n- 从零训练大型 Transformer\n- 第一版全量微调大模型\n\n输出：\n- best_predictor\n- model_config\n- model_comparison_report",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "a8",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
