			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778851842167,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "4. 生成模型路线\n\n前提：\n- 先有可靠强度预测器\n\n简单生成：\n- 随机突变\n- motif 替换\n- 片段交换\n- 遗传算法\n\n高级生成：\n- conditional diffusion\n- 输入 sequence + strength class\n- weak / medium / strong\n\n生成后：\n- 去重\n- 查 GC / repeat\n- 用预测模型打分\n- 选候选实验",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "4. 生成模型路线\n\n前提：\n- 先有可靠强度预测器\n\n简单生成：\n- 随机突变\n- motif 替换\n- 片段交换\n- 遗传算法\n\n高级生成：\n- conditional diffusion\n- 输入 sequence + strength class\n- weak / medium / strong\n\n生成后：\n- 去重\n- 查 GC / repeat\n- 用预测模型打分\n- 选候选实验",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "aA",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
